===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*dʰewbʰ-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|depe}}, {{m|enm|deep}}, {{m|enm|dep}}, {{m|enm|deop}}, from {{inh|en|ang|dēop|t=deep, profound; awful, mysterious; heinous; serious, solemn, earnest; extreme, great}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*deup}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*deupaz|t=deep}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro||*dʰewbʰ-nós}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*dʰewbʰ-|t=deep}}.

